{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Put One In for Johnny Minn</i>, each level is a self-contained set play. Score beautiful goals by diving for headers, bending free kicks, and blasting long shots from outside. Each play is a puzzle: use power, speed, and timing to bend, smash, or head the ball past the keeper and into the net. Time your shots for the highest contact score, and hit the corners for the best placement score. With full ragdoll-style physics, no two shots feel alike, and every goal comes down to precision and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diving Headers</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802120/extras/level-52-diving-header-goal-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1755285920\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Kicks</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802120/extras/level-80-free-kick-goal-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1755285920\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long Volleys</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802120/extras/level-76-volley-goal-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1755285920\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus on Set Plays</strong>: Score diving headers, free kicks, and long-shot puzzles instead of full-game simulations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Gameplay</strong>: Realistic ball arcs, collisions, and player animations make each attempt unpredictable and fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Style Levels</strong>: Analyze each scenario\u2014how the cross comes in, the defender's marking, the goalkeeper's positioning\u2014and figure out the best run to make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diving headers, long shots, volleys, and free kicks.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Presentation</strong>: Colorful low-poly graphics, expressive animations, and exaggerated camera angles turn every goal into a highlight reel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer</strong>: Play as the goalkeeper at any time with a second gamepad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Shot-for-Shot Mode</strong>: A pass-and-play party mode: take turns with your friends to score the best goal. Swap the controller after each turn\u2014<strong>only one gamepad required</strong>. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802120/extras/level-82-wall-smash-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1755285920\" /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802120?t=1755285920","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802120/7987245f185e2848f434af5a3966591c64c0429e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755285920","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802120/dd7b10d1336f7a2882c28cdaa326cd4d0e04c521/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755285920","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802120/dd7b10d1336f7a2882c28cdaa326cd4d0e04c521/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755285920","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Put One In for Johnny Minn</i>, each level is a self-contained set play. Score beautiful goals by diving for headers, bending free kicks, and blasting long shots from outside. Each play is a puzzle: use power, speed, and timing to bend, smash, or head the ball past the keeper and into the net. Time your shots for the highest contact score, and hit the corners for the best placement score. With full ragdoll-style physics, no two shots feel alike, and every goal comes down to precision and creativity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diving Headers</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802120/extras/level-52-diving-header-goal-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1755285920\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Free Kicks</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802120/extras/level-80-free-kick-goal-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1755285920\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Long Volleys</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802120/extras/level-76-volley-goal-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1755285920\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Focus on Set Plays</strong>: Score diving headers, free kicks, and long-shot puzzles instead of full-game simulations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Driven Gameplay</strong>: Realistic ball arcs, collisions, and player animations make each attempt unpredictable and fun.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Puzzle-Style Levels</strong>: Analyze each scenario\u2014how the cross comes in, the defender's marking, the goalkeeper's positioning\u2014and figure out the best run to make.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diving headers, long shots, volleys, and free kicks.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Presentation</strong>: Colorful low-poly graphics, expressive animations, and exaggerated camera angles turn every goal into a highlight reel.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Multiplayer</strong>: Play as the goalkeeper at any time with a second gamepad.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Local Shot-for-Shot Mode</strong>: A pass-and-play party mode: take turns with your friends to score the best goal. Swap the controller after each turn\u2014<strong>only one gamepad required</strong>. </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802120/extras/level-82-wall-smash-ezgif.com-optimize.gif?t=1755285920\" /></span></p>","developers":["piinecone"],"genres":[{"description":"Sports","id":"18"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802120/d7003a8fe49ba0adb389a58ee5a9e15150fcba7a/header.jpg?t=1755285920","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257181587,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181587/movie480.mp4?t=1755285919","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181587/movie_max.mp4?t=1755285919"},"name":"Gameplay","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257181587/dc8d1523e2c3df398634ea8b9b2c0d7ddda8d730/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755285919","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181587/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755285919","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257181587/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755285919"}}],"name":"Put One In for Johnny Minn","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/1